{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511405001:0":{"text":"땅거미 숲은 모두 정상이고, 악마의 흔적은 보이지 않아요.","source_cn":"薄暮丛林一切正常，似乎没有受到恶魔的侵扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BAAC7DC27335C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511405002:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D58BBC3776EA4DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","variant_male_record_index":"190832","variant_female_record_index":"190833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1511405002":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你有察觉到恶魔的气息吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D58BBC3776EA4DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 악마의 기운이 느껴지세요?","variant_male_record_index":"190832","variant_female_record_index":"190833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511405003:1":{"text":"그럼 사람들에게 물어봐요!","source_cn":"那我们就找人问问吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86F689E3DAE6C942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511405004:0":{"text":"사람? 뭘 물어보려고요? 제가 대답해 드릴 수 있을지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"找人？问什么？说不定我可以回答你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C86DFCF77529AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511405005:0":{"text":"와, 다미안! 이런 우연이!","source_cn":"哇！达米安！好巧啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9935FCF2801D12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511405006:1":{"text":"달빛호수 마을에 왔으니 절 만나는 건 당연한 일 아니겠어요?","source_cn":"你们来月湖村，碰到我是很正常的事啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07C6329B52952339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511405007:0":{"text":"그나저나 어떤 게 궁금하세요?","source_cn":"对了，你们要找人问什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3F216A9FC95F017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1511405007":{"text":"그나저나 어떤 게 궁금하세요?","source_cn":"对了，你们要找人问什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3F216A9FC95F017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511405008:0":{"text":"악, 악마요?! 그럴 리가요!","source_cn":"恶、恶魔？！怎么可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A647290E1E0562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511405009:0":{"text":"요즘 땅거미 숲에 일어나는 일이라고 해봤자 제 실패한 발명품이 소란을 일으키는 것뿐인데... 악마라니요!","source_cn":"薄暮丛林最近很平静，顶多就是我的几个失败发明闹出了一点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7333FE4F34D85B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511405010:1":{"text":"마스터가 전해 들은 소식은 악마가 한 아이의 꿈에 숨어들어 아이가 깨어나지 못하고 있다고 했어요.","source_cn":"梅林收到的消息是：恶魔藏在一个长睡不醒的小孩的梦里。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x052376012B75364D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터가 전해 들은 소식은 악마가 한 아이의 꿈에 숨어들어 아이가 깨어나지 못하고 있다고 했어요.","female":"마스터가 전해 들은 소식은 악마가 한 아이의 꿈에 숨어들어 아이가 깨어나지 못하고 있다고 했어요.","variant_male_record_index":"190841","variant_female_record_index":"190842","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511405011:1":{"text":"그래서 그 아이를 찾아야 하는데, 혹시 그런 사람을 아시나요?","source_cn":"所以，我们必须要找到那个孩子。你认识这样的人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB0D8EB8A0F66E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511405012:0":{"text":"깨어나지 못하는... 음, 그런 일은 들어본 적이 없는걸요...","source_cn":"长睡不醒……嗯，我好像没听说这样的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA531E5BCD7E7694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document